{{!-- The plain controls between two of a category's lines, as one run.

      A category is written in runs — the lettering, then how it is set, then
      its outline — and every other shape on a part could already be folded away
      but these. The name is read from the controls' own wording where they
      share any and from what kind of run it is where they do not, so it needs
      no wording of its own and cannot fall out of step with what it holds.

      Every control inside is still its own `.illuminus-field[data-field]` with
      the words it always had: the state switch, the filter, the changed markers
      and Reset all read the controls themselves. What changes is that the run
      above them can be shut. --}}
{{#if run.divider}}<hr class="illuminus-divider" aria-hidden="true">{{/if}}
<details class="illuminus-run" data-open="{{#if run.open}}1{{else}}0{{/if}}"
         {{#if run.open}}open{{/if}}>
  <summary class="illuminus-run__summary">
    <span class="illuminus-run__name">{{run.name}}</span>
    {{> "modules/illuminus/templates/style-run-says.hbs" says=run}}
  </summary>
  {{#each run.fields as |field|}}
  {{> "modules/illuminus/templates/style-field.hbs" field=field}}
  {{/each}}
</details>
